Package: synGE
Type: Package
Title: Generation and Evaluation of Synthetic Tabular Health Data: a comprehensive framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mieke L.M.", "Bentvelzen", email = "m.l.m.bentvelzen@umcutrecht.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Laura", "Jochim", role = "aut"),
    person("Said", "el Bouhaddani", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides functions to generate synthetic tabular data using
    sequential conditional synthesis (synthpop), vine copulas, conditional
    tabular generative adversarial networks (CTGAN), and tabular variational
    autoencoders (TVAE). Compares real and synthetic data using complementary
    metrics for marginal fidelity, bivariate associations, multivariate
    similarity, prediction-based distinguishability, and distance-based
    privacy screening. Intended for research on synthetic healthcare data;
    it does not establish that generated data are safe to disclose.
